WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Pick a big target. Warm up first. Choose a comfortable distance.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step toward your target. Use an easy throw. Accuracy matters more than power.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Reset between throws. Count your hits. Rest as needed and follow coach limits.

